amily:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">Whiteness &gt; &gt;98%</span><br/> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">Brightness % ≥ 101-104%</span><br/> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">Opacity %≥ &gt;94</span><br/> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">Smoothness Front ≥ </span><br/> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">Smoothness Back ≥ </span><br/> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">Surface Roughness TS ml/min 75-175</span><br/> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">Surface Roughness BS ml/min 100-200</span><br/> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">Bending stiffness MD &gt; &gt;110Mn</span><br/> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">Bending stiffness CD &gt; &gt;50Mn</span><br/> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">Variation of two sides % ≤ </span><br/> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">Sizing (mm) ≥ </span><br/> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">Ash % </span><br/> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">Moisture content % 3.5-4.5</span><br/> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">&lt; B&gt;Tightness (g/cm3) ≤ </span><br/> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">Surface strength (m/s) ≥&lt; /SPAN&gt; </span><br/> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">Dust / Dirt (piece/m2) ≤ &lt; /SPAN&gt;</span><br/> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">PH Value </span><br/> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">COBB Test g/m2 27-33</span><br/> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">Surface absorption g/m220 </span><br/> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">Fracture length km </span><br/> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">Substance (g/m2) GSM 80</span><br/> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">Substance variation CD (g) ≤ </span><br/> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">Thickness (um) 10.3-11.0</span><br/> <span style="color:#E53333;font-family:Tahoma;font-size:18px;">Thickness difference CD (um) ≤ </span></span></p>', '2026-09-06 20:58:45');